Third-party components

The Windows installer (Hoard-<version>-x64.msi) bundles an unmodified copy of
MySQL Community Server, which is licensed separately under the GNU General
Public License v2 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html).
Its source is published by Oracle at https://dev.mysql.com/downloads/. The
installer's License.rtf carries the notice shown at install time. Hoard itself
only connects to MySQL over TCP and does not link against it.
